# OneOS package set lineage: sha256sum of out/overlays_lineage_r6 (LineageOS 24.0, OnePlus 15 infiniti nightly of 2026-11-11, CP2A.260605.016; r1 of 2026-11-13 from scripts/make-overlays.sh with the gvld pins for its vold and service.incremental.so), minus tethering_payload.img and cellbroadcast_payload.img (One UI's modules stay, as for Infinity-X). No gmssystem payload: One UI's Google apps are laid over the guest's product partition at session time (guest_google.sh FULL mode). 0.5.06 r2: r1 plus OneOSPixelDoze.apk (AOD), 2026-11-14. 0.5.07 r3: r2 plus libbootanimation_preapex_patched.so (boot animation on every panel), 2026-11-14. 0.5.07 r4: services_patched.jar with patches/guest_sp_migration_tolerant.py, 2026-11-14.
# 0.5.17 r8: services_patched.jar with the guest lock's gatekeeper handle, so the setup
# wizard's face enrollment gets a token (switcher/patches/guest_local_lock_hat.py), and guards.txt
# with its hash, 2026-11-16.
# app/build.gradle.kts packs exactly these files into the APK and fails the build when out/overlays_lineage_r6 differs.
# 0.5.14 r6: r5 with the current OneOSGuest.apk and Samsung Camera (samcam_a.tar for A/M phones, samcam_bar.tar for bar phones).
# 0.5.15 r7: framework_patched.jar with Samsung slow motion's three-output high-speed session; samcam_a.tar without libmediaresourcehelper (A-series video).
# 0.5.20 r11: facehal_payload.tar (the guest face HAL and Samsung's five vendor libraries; Samsung's own
# face HAL refuses the guest's framework), 2026-11-16.
